 hidden dungeons, solve puzzles, and unlock the mysteries of Crafters Heaven.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner crafter, survive the wilderness, and carve your own path in this enchanting lowpoly world. Are you ready to build your heaven?</p>","developers":["David Aust"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791670/174c66198ee9019665503608b34061332236dc41/header.jpg?t=1757772649","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 David Aust / HeavensMadCraft Studio. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Crafters Heaven","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-2100 / AMD FX-6300 <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 460 / AMD Radeon HD 5850 oder integrierte Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6500 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 660 / AMD Radeon HD 7870 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["HeavensMadCraft Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Atos criminosos\nViol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required